      ],
      "text": "The Java Upgrade workflow detects the environment (JDKs, Maven/Gradle, Java EE version, multi-module layout), installs JDKs via SDKMAN or WinGet, applies recipes, optionally migrates javax.* to jakarta.*, and runs an agentic fix loop until the build compiles."
